## Verification (Anthropic-style: provide testable criteria)

```bash
# Layer 3: hook fires for general command
echo '{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"git status"}}' \
  | node "%USERPROFILE%/.claude/hooks/rtk-prerewrite.js"
# Expected: {"modified_input":{"command":"rtk git status"}}

# Layer 3: already-prefixed passes through
echo '{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"rtk tsc --noEmit"}}' \
  | node "%USERPROFILE%/.claude/hooks/rtk-prerewrite.js"
# Expected: (empty stdout)

# Layer 3: chain rewrites each segment
echo '{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"git add . && git commit -m \"x\""}}' \
  | node "%USERPROFILE%/.claude/hooks/rtk-prerewrite.js"
# Expected: {"modified_input":{"command":"rtk git add . && rtk git commit -m \"x\""}}

# Layer 3: pipe NOT split (continuation, not standalone command)
echo '{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"git log | head -10"}}' \
  | node "%USERPROFILE%/.claude/hooks/rtk-prerewrite.js"
# Expected: {"modified_input":{"command":"rtk git log | head -10"}}

# Layer 3: exempt builtins pass through
echo '{"tool_name":"Bash","tool_input":{"command":"echo hello"}}' \
  | node "%USERPROFILE%/.claude/hooks/rtk-prerewrite.js"
# Expected: (empty stdout)

# End-to-end verification (Anthropic-native verification loop):
# After 1 session under the new hook:
#   rtk gain         → counter should reflect 100% auto-prefix coverage
#   rtk discover     → should approach zero (no missed opportunities)
#   reports/token-usage.md → should show rtk discover block appended per session
```

